### Tests Fase 2 - Mikelo
### Usar con REST Client de VS Code o similar
### Ajustar @baseUrl según tu entorno

@baseUrl = http://localhost/test/api

### =====================================================
### 1. TEST DE CONEXIÓN
### =====================================================

### Test básico
GET {{baseUrl}}/test HTTP/1.1

### =====================================================
### 2. AUTENTICACIÓN - LOGIN
### =====================================================

### Login con admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "usuario": "admin",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### Guardar token del login
@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### =====================================================
### 3. AUTENTICACIÓN - VALIDACIÓN
### =====================================================

### Validar token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/validar HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener datos del usuario actual
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================
### 4. LOGIN FRANQUICIA
### =====================================================

### Login con franquicia
# @name loginFranquicia
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "usuario": "franquicia_test",
    "password": "franquicia123"
}

### Guardar token franquicia
@tokenFranquicia = {{loginFranquicia.response.body.token}}

### =====================================================
### 5. PEDIDOS
### =====================================================

### Listar todos los pedidos (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pedidos HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar pedidos de la franquicia
GET {{baseUrl}}/pedidos HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFranquicia}}

### Crear nuevo pedido (como franquicia)
# @name crearPedido
POST {{baseUrl}}/pedidos HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFranquicia}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id_sucursal": 2,
    "observaciones": "Pedido de prueba desde test HTTP",
    "items": [
        {
            "id_producto": 1,
            "cantidad": 10,
            "observaciones": "Prueba producto 1"
        }
    ]
}

### Guardar ID del pedido creado
@idPedido = {{crearPedido.response.body.pedido.id}}

### Ver detalle del pedido
GET {{baseUrl}}/pedidos/{{idPedido}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFranquicia}}

### Actualizar pedido (agregar items)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pedidos/{{idPedido}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFranquicia}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "observaciones": "Pedido actualizado",
    "items": [
        {
            "id_producto": 1,
            "cantidad": 15,
            "observaciones": "Cantidad aumentada"
        },
        {
            "id_producto": 2,
            "cantidad": 5,
            "observaciones": "Producto agregado"
        }
    ]
}

### Cancelar pedido
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pedidos/{{idPedido}}/cancelar HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFranquicia}}

### =====================================================
### 6. STOCK SUCURSAL
### =====================================================

### Ver stock de sucursal 2 (Elordi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock-sucursal?id_sucursal=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar producto en stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock-sucursal/buscar?id_sucursal=2&q=helado HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFranquicia}}

### Ver movimientos de un producto
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock-sucursal/movimientos?id_sucursal=2&id_producto=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFranquicia}}

### Resumen de stock para dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock-sucursal/resumen?id_sucursal=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFranquicia}}

### =====================================================
### 7. RECEPCIONES
### =====================================================

### Listar recepciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/recepciones HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFranquicia}}

### Ver envíos pendientes de recepción para sucursal 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/recepciones/envios-pendientes?id_sucursal=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFranquicia}}

### Crear recepción (cuando haya un envío pendiente)
# POST {{baseUrl}}/recepciones HTTP/1.1
# Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFranquicia}}
# Content-Type: application/json
